{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ink Enigma: Hidden Object Challenges turns every hand-drawn puzzle page into your personal sketchbook. Scan the scene, circle each secret, and watch the artwork come alive with your own signature ink.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Why It Feels So Good</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Draw to Discover \u2013 Spot an item, press the trigger, and shhkk!\u2014a lively marker-stroke wraps around it as if you sketched it yourself. A crisp checklist tick follows with an old-school paper-flip sound.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Page-Turner Puzzles \u2013 Enjoy a growing gallery of lovingly illustrated scenes, with even more discoveries planned for future updates.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Personal Best Timing \u2013 Every page records your fastest completion time, inviting you to out-ink your own record whenever inspiration strikes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your Marker, Your Style \u2013 Tweak opacity, thickness, and hue: go subtle pencil-grey or blaze neon\u2014no two finished pages have to look the same.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Relax &amp; Recline \u2013 Warm parchment tones, gentle jazz-hop loops, zero jump-scares. Perfect for five-minute brain breaks or long, cozy play sessions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pick-Up-and-Play Controls \u2013 Controller, mouse, or touch\u2014the UI instantly adapts to whatever you grab.</p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"It Begins","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3792890/adfbaf8c5e572fa02f69e7099618ff2762ba2971.jpg"},{"name":"Rookie Finder","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3792890/b1b971275fda548f72d48ea1d80077728733b271.jpg"},{"name":"Seasoned Seeker","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3792890/112330b6371b9666c2c6a7bd57c510797b4a1944.jpg"},{"name":"Master of Clutter","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/app