e into your personal sketchbook. Scan the scene, circle each secret, and watch the artwork come alive with your own signature ink.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Why It Feels So Good</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Draw to Discover \u2013 Spot an item, press the trigger, and shhkk!\u2014a lively marker-stroke wraps around it as if you sketched it yourself. A crisp checklist tick follows with an old-school paper-flip sound.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Page-Turner Puzzles \u2013 Enjoy a growing gallery of lovingly illustrated scenes, with even more discoveries planned for future updates.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Personal Best Timing \u2013 Every page records your fastest completion time, inviting you to out-ink your own record whenever inspiration strikes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your Marker, Your Style \u2013 Tweak opacity, thickness, and hue: go subtle pencil-grey or blaze neon\u2014no two finished pages have to look the same.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Relax &amp; Recline \u2013 Warm parchment tones, gentle jazz-hop loops, zero jump-scares. Perfect for five-minute brain breaks or long, cozy play sessions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pick-Up-and-Play Controls \u2013 Controller, mouse, or touch\u2014the UI instantly adapts to whatever you grab.</p>","developers":["AVGAM"],"genres":[{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3792890/bd5e41113b5a8828e102700b8c534ce75a956c3d/header.jpg?t=1755879140","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3792890/1293610948/ecf5f4af17a7a613797